<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>About Us — Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'about' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero has-media py-56-64">
  <img class="hero-media" src="media/headers/about.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async">
  <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <h1 class="hero-title-clamp" data-cs="about.hero.title">{{ sections["about.hero"].title }}</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-cs="about.hero.lede">{{ sections["about.hero"].lede }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-40-8">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card-grid grid-autofit-240">
      <div class="card"><h3>Our Story</h3><p>How one family's journey became a community's sanctuary.</p><a class="more" href="#story">Read our story →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Mission &amp; Vision</h3><p>Caregivers first — wellness, rest, and community without judgment.</p><a class="more" href="#mission">What guides us →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Meet Our Team</h3><p>The people behind Legacy's programs and partnerships.</p><a class="more" href="#team">Meet the team →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Meet Shanelle</h3><p>Our founder's story — the lived experience behind the mission.</p><a class="more" href="#shanelle">About our founder →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Board of Directors</h3><p>Governance and leadership.</p><a class="more" href="#board">See the board →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Annual Reports &amp; Financials</h3><p>Transparency documents and yearly impact reports.</p><a class="more" href="#reports">View reports →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Careers</h3><p>Work with us to support caregiving families.</p><a class="more" href="#careers">Openings →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Our Impact</h3><p>The difference we're making, in numbers and stories.</p><a class="more" href="#impact">See our impact →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Caregiver Voices</h3><p>What caregivers say about the Legacy community.</p><a class="more" href="#voices">Hear their voices →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Blog &amp; Stories</h3><p>Caregiving in real life, from the Legacy community.</p><a class="more" href="blog.html">Read the blog →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Contact</h3><p>Reach a real person — questions, support, media, speaking.</p><a class="more" href="#contact">Get in touch →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow" data-cs="about.story.eyebrow">{{ sections["about.story"].eyebrow }}</span>
        <h2 class="mb-14" data-cs="about.story.heading">{{ sections["about.story"].heading }}</h2>
        <div data-cs-list="about.story.paragraphs" data-cs-item="p.muted.mb-16">
{%- for p in sections["about.story"].paragraphs %}
        <p class="muted mb-16">{{ p }}</p>
{%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="small muted"><em data-cs="about.story.note">{{ sections["about.story"].note }}</em></p>
      </div>
      <div class="visual" id="mission">
        <h3 class="fs-18-mb-14" data-cs="about.values.heading">{{ sections["about.values"].heading }}</h3>
{%- for it in sections["about.values"]["items"] %}
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot bg-coral"></div><div><strong>{{ it.title }}</strong><div class="when">{{ it.when }}</div></div></div>
{%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="shanelle">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our founder</span><h2>Meet Shanelle</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-620">Legacy's founder cared for her mother through younger-onset dementia — the lived experience the whole organization is built on. Her full story, in her own words, is coming here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sand" id="team">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our people</span><h2>Meet Our Team</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-620">Team bios and photos will live here as Legacy shares them.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>
    <div class="section-head mt-40" id="board"><span class="eyebrow">Governance</span><h2>Board of Directors</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-620">Board member listings will be published here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="reports">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Transparency</span><h2>Annual Reports &amp; Financials</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-620">Annual reports and financial documents will be available for download here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>
    <div class="section-head mt-40" id="careers"><span class="eyebrow">Join the team</span><h2>Careers</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-620">Open roles will be posted here. Interested in volunteering in the meantime? See <a href="get-involved.html#volunteer">Get Involved</a>.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sand" id="impact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our impact</span><h2>Together, we're making a difference.</h2></div>
    <div class="stats-grid text-center-aligned">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num hero-title">70+</div><div class="label">Family Caregivers Supported</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num hero-title">1,000+</div><div class="label">Hours of Respite Provided</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num hero-title">100,000+</div><div class="label">Community Members Reached</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num hero-title">30</div><div class="label">Individuals Living with Dementia</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-head mt-40" id="voices"><span class="eyebrow">Caregiver voices</span><h2>In their words</h2></div>
    <p class="measure-620-italic">"Legacy reminded me that I mattered too."</p>
    <p class="measure-620-italic">"Before Legacy, I felt completely alone. Now I have a community that understands what I'm going through."</p>
    <div class="section-head mt-40" id="supporters"><span class="eyebrow">With thanks</span><h2>Our Supporters</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-620">The donors, partners, and foundations who make this work possible will be recognized here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h2>Reach a real person</h2></div>
    <p class="muted measure-620">Questions about programs, media inquiries, or speaking requests — start with <a href="request-support.html">Request Support</a> and we'll route it to the right person. Direct contact details will be published here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Contact details coming</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-sand">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-cs="about.join.eyebrow">{{ sections["about.join"].eyebrow }}</span>
    <h2 class="mb-14" data-cs="about.join.heading">{{ sections["about.join"].heading }}</h2>
    <p class="muted measure-540-center-mb-28" data-cs="about.join.body">{{ sections["about.join"].body }}</p>
    <a href="programs.html" class="btn btn-coral" data-cs="about.join.cta_label">{{ sections["about.join"].cta_label }}</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
